TI  - Officiating bias: The effect of foul differential on foul calls in NCAA basketball
AU  - Anderson, Kyle J.
AU  - Pierce, David A.
PY  - 2009
UR  - https://doi.org/10.1080/02640410902729733
DO  - 10.1080/02640410902729733
